      "title": "A tool that reports only a full path still names the same artifact",
      "rationale": "YARA and osquery file events carry `file.path` and no `file.name`. Without reading the path, those records entered the store carrying no artifact at all, so a YARA match could never bridge to the EVTX that executed the same binary — the single most obvious link a scanner is bought for.",
